  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/lodentityrendering/raw/6eed3e6ca79b5666f7f9ab3ca4e5c61ec3576131/docs/assets/icon/icon_128x128.png\" alt=\"LOD 實體渲染圖示\"></p><h1>LOD 實體渲染</h1><p>此 Minecraft 模組能在 Distant Horizons 的 LOD 中渲染實體。</p><h2>依賴項目</h2><h3>必要項目</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdistanthorizons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Distant Horizons</a>\n<ul>\n<li>至少需要 <code>v2.2.1</code> 版本</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h2>相容性資訊</h2><h3>相容模組</h3><p>LOD 實體渲染應與大多數（若非全部）與 Distant Horizons 相容的模組相容。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>\n<ul>\n<li>LOD 實體渲染內建資源包，為 Create 添加實體顏色</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h3>不相容項目</h3><p>請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/lodentityrendering/issues?q=is:issue is:open sort:updated-desc label:compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a> 以查看不相容項目清單。</p><h2>下載</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/lodentityrendering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flodentityrendering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lodentityrendering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/compact/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/compact/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Quilt\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/compact/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/lodentityrendering/raw/a7ebbf9844755f6f53218b2a2aebed97b6ff5220/docs/assets/badges/compact/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></p><p>支援的 Minecraft 版本請參閱檔案名稱中的版本資訊。<br>\n適用於 Fabric、Quilt、Forge 及 NeoForge 模組載入器。<br>\n支援客戶端與伺服器端。</p><h2>常見問題</h2><ul>\n<li><p>問：是否會將此模組回溯至較舊的 Minecraft 版本？<br>\n答：不會。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>問：此模組在多人遊戲中是否可用？<br>\n答：是的。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>問：僅伺服器需要此模組，還是客戶端也需要？<br>\n答：伺服器與客戶端皆需安裝此模組。</p>\n</li>\n</ul><h2>授權條款</h2><p>本專案採用 LGPLv3 授權，詳見 <a href=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/lodentityrendering/blob/1.20.1/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a>。</p>",
